{"id":266,"slug":"266-for-of-va-for-in-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"ES6+","level":"beginner","question_vi":"for...of và for...in khác nhau như thế nào?","question_en":"What is the difference between for...of and for...in?","answer_vi":"`for...in` duyệt **key**, `for...of` duyệt **value**.\n\n```javascript\nconst arr = ['a', 'b', 'c']\n\nfor (const i of arr) console.log(i)   // 'a' 'b' 'c' — giá trị\nfor (const i in arr) console.log(i)  // '0' '1' '2' — chỉ số, KIỂU CHUỖI\n```\n\n| | `for...in` | `for...of` |\n|---|---|---|\n| Duyệt | key enumerable | value của iterable |\n| Đi lên prototype chain | **có** | không |\n| Dùng với | object thường | Array, String, Map, Set, NodeList, generator |\n| Object thường | được | **TypeError** — không iterable |\n\nHai lý do không nên dùng `for...in` với mảng:\n\n```javascript\nArray.prototype.custom = 1        // một thư viện cũ thêm vào\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k)   // '0' '1' '2' 'custom'  ← lọt cả kế thừa\n\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k + 1)   // '01' '11' '21' 'custom1' — key là chuỗi (và vẫn lọt key kế thừa)\n```\n\nDuyệt object đúng cách ở code hiện đại:\n\n```javascript\nfor (const [key, value] of Object.entries(obj)) { }\nObject.keys(obj).forEach((k) => { })\n\n// nếu buộc dùng for...in thì lọc lại\nfor (const k in obj) {\n  if (!Object.hasOwn(obj, k)) continue\n}\n```\n\n**Chốt:** mảng và mọi thứ iterable → `for...of`. Object → `Object.entries()`. `for...in` chỉ còn hợp lý khi thật sự cần cả thuộc tính kế thừa, trường hợp rất hiếm","answer_en":"`for...in` iterates **keys**, `for...of` iterates **values**.\n\n```javascript\nconst arr = ['a', 'b', 'c']\n\nfor (const i of arr) console.log(i)   // 'a' 'b' 'c' — values\nfor (const i in arr) console.log(i)  // '0' '1' '2' — indices, AS STRINGS\n```\n\n| | `for...in` | `for...of` |\n|---|---|---|\n| Iterates | enumerable keys | values of an iterable |\n| Walks the prototype chain | **yes** | no |\n| Works with | plain objects | Array, String, Map, Set, NodeList, generators |\n| Plain objects | yes | **TypeError** — not iterable |\n\nTwo reasons not to use `for...in` on arrays:\n\n```javascript\nArray.prototype.custom = 1        // some old library added this\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k)   // '0' '1' '2' 'custom'  <- inherited leaks in\n\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k + 1)   // '01' '11' '21' 'custom1' — keys are strings (and the inherited key still leaks)\n```\n\nIterating objects the modern way:\n\n```javascript\nfor (const [key, value] of Object.entries(obj)) { }\nObject.keys(obj).forEach((k) => { })\n\n// if you must use for...in, filter\nfor (const k in obj) {\n  if (!Object.hasOwn(obj, k)) continue\n}\n```\n\n**Takeaway:** arrays and anything iterable → `for...of`. Objects → `Object.entries()`. `for...in` only earns its place when inherited properties genuinely matter, which is rare","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>for...in</code> duyệt <strong>key</strong>, <code>for...of</code> duyệt <strong>value</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const arr = ['a', 'b', 'c']\n\nfor (const i of arr) console.log(i)   // 'a' 'b' 'c' — giá trị\nfor (const i in arr) console.log(i)  // '0' '1' '2' — chỉ số, KIỂU CHUỖI\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> arr = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;c&#x27;</span>]\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> i <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">of</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(i)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a&#x27; &#x27;b&#x27; &#x27;c&#x27; — giá trị</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> i <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(i)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;0&#x27; &#x27;1&#x27; &#x27;2&#x27; — chỉ số, KIỂU CHUỖI</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th></th><th><code>for...in</code></th><th><code>for...of</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Duyệt</td><td>key enumerable</td><td>value của iterable</td></tr><tr><td>Đi lên prototype chain</td><td><strong>có</strong></td><td>không</td></tr><tr><td>Dùng với</td><td>object thường</td><td>Array, String, Map, Set, NodeList, generator</td></tr><tr><td>Object thường</td><td>được</td><td><strong>TypeError</strong> — không iterable</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Hai lý do không nên dùng <code>for...in</code> với mảng:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"Array.prototype.custom = 1        // một thư viện cũ thêm vào\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k)   // '0' '1' '2' 'custom'  ← lọt cả kế thừa\n\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k + 1)   // '01' '11' '21' 'custom1' — key là chuỗi (và vẫn lọt key kế thừa)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">prototype</span></span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">custom</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// một thư viện cũ thêm vào</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> k <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(k)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;0&#x27; &#x27;1&#x27; &#x27;2&#x27; &#x27;custom&#x27;  ← lọt cả kế thừa</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> k <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(k + <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;01&#x27; &#x27;11&#x27; &#x27;21&#x27; &#x27;custom1&#x27; — key là chuỗi (và vẫn lọt key kế thừa)</span></code></pre></div><p>Duyệt object đúng cách ở code hiện đại:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(obj)) { }\nObject.keys(obj).forEach((k) =&gt; { })\n\n// nếu buộc dùng for...in thì lọc lại\nfor (const k in obj) {\n  if (!Object.hasOwn(obj, k)) continue\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> [key, value] <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">of</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">entries</span>(obj)) { }\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">keys</span>(obj).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">k</span>) =&gt;</span> { })\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// nếu buộc dùng for...in thì lọc lại</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> k <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> obj) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">hasOwn</span>(obj, k)) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">continue</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> mảng và mọi thứ iterable → <code>for...of</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Object → <code>Object.entries()</code>. <code>for...in</code> chỉ còn hợp lý khi thật sự cần cả thuộc tính kế thừa, trường hợp rất hiếm.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>for...in</code> iterates <strong>keys</strong>, <code>for...of</code> iterates <strong>values</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const arr = ['a', 'b', 'c']\n\nfor (const i of arr) console.log(i)   // 'a' 'b' 'c' — values\nfor (const i in arr) console.log(i)  // '0' '1' '2' — indices, AS STRINGS\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> arr = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;c&#x27;</span>]\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> i <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">of</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(i)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;a&#x27; &#x27;b&#x27; &#x27;c&#x27; — values</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> i <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(i)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;0&#x27; &#x27;1&#x27; &#x27;2&#x27; — indices, AS STRINGS</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th></th><th><code>for...in</code></th><th><code>for...of</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Iterates</td><td>enumerable keys</td><td>values of an iterable</td></tr><tr><td>Walks the prototype chain</td><td><strong>yes</strong></td><td>no</td></tr><tr><td>Works with</td><td>plain objects</td><td>Array, String, Map, Set, NodeList, generators</td></tr><tr><td>Plain objects</td><td>yes</td><td><strong>TypeError</strong> — not iterable</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Two reasons not to use <code>for...in</code> on arrays:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"Array.prototype.custom = 1        // some old library added this\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k)   // '0' '1' '2' 'custom'  &lt;- inherited leaks in\n\nfor (const k in arr) console.log(k + 1)   // '01' '11' '21' 'custom1' — keys are strings (and the inherited key still leaks)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">prototype</span></span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">custom</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// some old library added this</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> k <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(k)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;0&#x27; &#x27;1&#x27; &#x27;2&#x27; &#x27;custom&#x27;  &lt;- inherited leaks in</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> k <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> arr) <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(k + <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;01&#x27; &#x27;11&#x27; &#x27;21&#x27; &#x27;custom1&#x27; — keys are strings (and the inherited key still leaks)</span></code></pre></div><p>Iterating objects the modern way:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(obj)) { }\nObject.keys(obj).forEach((k) =&gt; { })\n\n// if you must use for...in, filter\nfor (const k in obj) {\n  if (!Object.hasOwn(obj, k)) continue\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> [key, value] <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">of</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">entries</span>(obj)) { }\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">keys</span>(obj).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">k</span>) =&gt;</span> { })\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// if you must use for...in, filter</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> k <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> obj) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">hasOwn</span>(obj, k)) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">continue</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Takeaway:</strong> arrays and anything iterable → <code>for...of</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Objects → <code>Object.entries()</code>. <code>for...in</code> only earns its place when inherited properties genuinely matter, which is rare.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — for...of","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/for...of"},{"label":"MDN — for...in","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/for...in"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}